{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\", \"C4\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C2/C3最好地把疲惫、对过去重要事物的留恋、仍找不到继续生活的办法，以及选边压力的松动连成一条心理过程；C1次之，但重复自我提醒较多；C4虽然简洁，却对疲惫和无力重新讲述往事的解释不足。keep：清单明确标为“无”，没有可供比较的指定实质内容，四者不宜强行区分，列表仅按候选顺序排列。cover：C2/C3最完整地解释了B3的旧问题重新浮现、B4的疲惫回望，以及B1声音只能零碎浮现的心理原因；C1也有疲惫和两难，但对无力重述的表达稍弱；C4缺少疲惫这一关键原因。lean：C4心理步骤最少，基本是过去两种生活经验、现实阻碍、仍想兼顾、选择压力松动的连续推进；C2/C3虽然多一层反复思量，但各步仍有作用；C1对护住安宁和休息不等于放弃的意思重复较明显。plain：C4最像一个人在讲自己的处境，尤其是“当初不肯再等的事还没解决，想留住安宁也得面对它们”，具体而有来由；C1次之；C2/C3的“那种生活”“究竟想护住什么”等表达稍显概括。C2与C3内容完全相同，各项排名并列，先后仅按编号。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0a597e8b-8a4b-423d-9291-204b86e36875", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005618553544Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.187, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:57:30.745275+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f66b00959c0c68f727197cd59c7c38a32bc5d83cafdec7ca98ac5e298f28cc5f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicabl